#
# The Windows scripts need Windows line ends (cmd.exe mishandles labels and
# goto in a file with Unix ones).  Git keeps them as LF in the repository and
# checks them out with CRLF.  scripts/package-for-windows converts only files
# that have no CRLF, so it works with either checkout.
windows/*.bat text eol=crlf
windows/README.txt text eol=crlf
